; Rescued, not a starter: the Scorched Sands' chapter wizard, freed by turning the bronze mirrors round his tomb
; until the sun reaches its door (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.6, .ai/unlock-puzzles.md 3.1). Architect of the first
; pyramid, physician, High Priest of Ra. His passive is Surveyor, the one axis no other wizard owns: the reach at
; which orbs and pickups come to him (+20%).
; He opens on Scorching Ray since 2026-11-09 (.ai/character-fit.md section 1): a ray that heats up on one target is
; the sun focused through his bronze mirror, the same act that frees him. Fire + Arcane, earned by everyone else
; through the fire_adept achievement; he holds it whatever the save owns (Player.GetLevelUpOptions offers a wizard
; his own opener). He opened on Fireball before, which stays the Sands boss's deed spell. His form, the Eye of Ra,
; deepens Fire.
